  "instructions": [
    "Cook the rice noodles according to package instructions and set aside.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the coconut oil over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced Vietnamese peppers and cook until they start to soften.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the ferment-jang, fish sauce, lime juice, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the skillet and toss everything together.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
